Error [jet.RetiredCopySigil]: The `~` copy sigil is retired; a copy is the method `x.copy()`
  --> tests/ui/retired_copy_sigil.jet:3:15
    |
  3 |     copied :: ~name
    |               ^
 Why: Jet has exactly one spelling for a deliberate copy, the built-in method `.copy()`, so a copy reads as a word and chains like any method
 Fix: Write `name.copy()`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0941
